      <p begin="00:18.430" end="00:21.400" ttm:agent="v1">Told you not 또 괜한 기대</p>
      <p begin="00:21.400" end="00:24.830" ttm:agent="v1">겉으론 걱정해, 난 안 바뀌네</p>
      <p begin="00:24.830" end="00:27.600" ttm:agent="v1">또 가끔 말을 막 해, 너무 딱해</p>
      <p begin="00:27.600" end="00:33.320" ttm:agent="v1">헛소리들 나는 안 들리네, no, oh yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:33.320" end="00:36.230" ttm:agent="v1">Told you, 난 so always b-day</p>
      <p begin="00:36.230" end="00:39.640" ttm:agent="v1">겉으론 내 편인데 못해 이해</p>
