      <p begin="00:42.340" end="00:47.910" ttm:agent="v1">어떻게 해도 나는 안 들리네, no, no, oh</p>
      <p begin="00:47.910" end="00:52.560" ttm:agent="v1">타 버리고 파 너의 사랑은 so sunny, yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:52.560" end="00:55.480" ttm:agent="v1">사라져도, 사라져도</p>
      <p begin="00:55.480" end="00:59.860" ttm:agent="v1">다 버리고 파 너만 있다면 no worry, yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:59.860" end="01:01.990" ttm:agent="v1">알잖아 it should be you</p>
      <p begin="01:01.990" end="01:06.070" ttm:agent="v1">So I'll run to you</p>
